-Cadence DPHY
-============
-
-Cadence DPHY block.
-
-Required properties:
-- compatible: should be set to "cdns,dphy".
-- reg: physical base address and length of the DPHY registers.
-- clocks: DPHY reference clocks.
-- clock-names: must contain "psm" and "pll_ref".
